  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/02/IMG_4762.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(26 fotos) Juan jos&eacute; Piquer Marco, Toni Vida Serrano y Ricardo Romero han sido los agraciados en el sorteo realizado por New Robinson, en la calle San Bernardo, esquina Salvador Barri de Onda, con motivo de San Valent&iacute;n. Les han correspondido sendos vales canjeables por 40 &euro; en el restaurante Toledo.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigsantvalentinewrobinson18/img_4733.jpg\" alt=\"img_4733\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigsantvalentinewrobinson18/img_4737.jpg\" alt=\"img_4737\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigsantvalentinewrobinson18/img_4739.jpg\" alt=\"img_4739\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigsantvalentinewrobinson18/img_4742.jpg\" alt=\"img_4742\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigsantvalentinewrobinson18/img_4744.jpg\" alt=\"img_4744\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigsantvalentinewrobinson18/img_4745.jpg\" alt=\"img_4745\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigsantvalentinewrobinson18/img_4746.jpg\" alt=\"img_4746\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigsantvalentinewrobinson18/img_4749.jpg\" alt=\"img_4749\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigsantvalentinewrobi